# ── DOCS  ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Project documentation is version-controlled (AGENTS.md §53/54 requires maintaining
# docs/application-automation/). The blanket *.md ignore previously swallowed the entire
# docs/ tree — 54 documents were never committed because of it.
#
# ⚠️ The blanket rule was never actually fixed: only AGENTS.md is excepted, so new root-level
# docs are still dropped silently (measured 2026-09-26: 3 files under docs/ are untracked).
# See server_bugs.md SB-15. Add an explicit exception for each doc that must be committed.
*.md
!AGENTS.md
!server_bugs.md
!refactor_audit.md

